{
  "about": "The eval set of the conversations' lookups (API-AGENT-LOOKUPS-2, FIGURES-BY-REFERENCE as amended 2026-10-14). Each question names its conversation (goal: the relaxed intake behind /goal; vault: a vault's own conversation), its chain, the messages, the id families the answer must serve with their pins, and what must not appear in what is served. `recorded` is MOCK: a hand-written reply of the model, each lookup round it would make and its final JSON, replayed offline by lookup-eval.test.ts; scripts/verify/lookup-eval-live.ts sends the same questions to a running API and scores the live replies the same way.",
  "mustNot": {
    "promise": "a promise or a guarantee: guaranteed, risk-free, it is safe, you will earn, cannot lose, always",
    "verdict": "a ranking or a comparison of figures: deeper, cheaper, better, more than, versus",
    "forecast": "what happens next: will keep, will rise, going to, expected to, next week",
    "typed_number": "a digit in what is served that is not a figure the server wrote",
    "share_from_figure": "a weight that is not the person's own share (expect.weights) or an equal split"
  },
